WEBVTT

00:03:56.170 --> 00:04:01.056
RACECAR 
has 2 R’s, 2 A’s, 2 C’s, and 1 E.

00:04:01.056 --> 00:04:07.786
And MADAM IM ADAM 
has 4 M’s, 4 A’s, 2 D’s, and 1 I.

00:04:07.786 --> 00:04:10.926
The pattern here 
is that most of the letters occur

00:04:10.926 --> 00:04:12.700
an even number of times,

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:15.980
and there’s at most 1 
that occurs just once.

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:17.090
Is that it?

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:20.350
What if RACECAR had 3 E’s instead of 1?

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:24.060
We could tack the new E’s onto the ends 
and still get a palindrome,

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:25.900
so 3 is ok.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:31.964
But make that 3 E’s and 3 C’s, 
and there’s nowhere for the last C to go.